  "prefLabel": "Rev 1206.03 Penalties for Fraudulent Claims",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1206.03 Penalties for Fraudulent Claims. If a claimant receives relief for a fraudulent claim, the claimant shall be assessed for the amount of relief issued plus interest as provided under RSA 21-J:28 and an additional penalty of the greater of 25 percent of the amount of relief issued or $1,000.\n\nSource. #9946, eff 6-23-11; ss by #12923, eff 11-26-19\n\nAPPENDIX\n\nRule | Statute\n\nRev 1201.01 | RSA 198:56, I\n\nRev 1201.02 | RSA 21:44\n\nRev 1201.03 | RSA 198:57\n\nRev 1201.04 | RSA 198:57\n\nRev 1201.05 | RSA 198:57\n\nRev 1201.06 | RSA 198:56, V\n\nRev 1201.07 | RSA 198:56, II\n\nRev 1201.08 | RSA 198:56, III\n\nRev 1201.09 | RSA 198:56, I\n\nRev 1202.01 | RSA 198:57, III\n\nRev 1203.01 | RSA 198:57, VI\n\nRev 1203.02 | RSA 198:57, VII\n\nRev 1204.01 | RSA 198:61\n\nRev 1204.02 | RSA 198:60\n\nRev 1205.01 | RSA 198:61\n\nRev 1206.01 | RSA 198:59\n\nRev 1206.02 | RSA 198:59, II\n\nRev 1206.03 | RSA 198:59, II",
